DESCRIPTION:OCTOBER 25-30\, 2026. The Edge. Duke Library. West Campus\nCOR
 N MANDALA.\nGuest Artist Jorge Taylor Rojas (U.S/Mexico - based in Salt L
 ake City\, Utah) will lead the collaborative installation of his latest e
 dition of CORN MANDALA. A design commissioned for GROUNDING AMERICA will 
 take place at Duke University Libraries\, THE EDGE HALL.\nContact us at: 
 miguel.rojassotelo@duke.edu to help build the MANDALA.
