DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Chorale-o-ween with an evening of music honoring Día
  de los Muertos and the rich choral heritage of Mexico.\n\nThe Duke Chora
 le is joined by Mariachi Toro de Duke\, Son de Carolina\, and special gue
 st Sophia Enríquez for a vibrant celebration of remembrance\, tradition\,
  and community. Through voices\, instruments\, and shared musical traditi
 ons\, this spirited performance brings together the joy\, reflection\, an
 d cultural richness at the heart of Día de los Muertos.\n\nThis event is 
 free and open to the public. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H
