CREATED:20260714T174511Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience the artistry and insight of acclaimed pianist Awada
 gin Pratt in this engaging masterclass.\n\nPraised by The Washington Post
  as "one of this country's most interesting and profound pianists\," Prat
 t is among the most distinctive voices in American classical music. A win
 ner of the Naumburg International Piano Competition and recipient of an A
 very Fisher Career Grant\, he has performed in solo recitals at Carnegie 
 Hall and the Kennedy Center and appeared with leading orchestras across t
 he country.\n\nThrough live coaching and musical exploration\, Pratt will
  offer students and audience members a rare look into the interpretive ch
 oices\, technique\, and creative process behind a compelling performance.
 \n\nThis event is free and open to the public. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H30M
DTSTAMP:20260715T165820Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T150000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260715T165820Z
