DESCRIPTION:The Congregation at Duke Chapel invites you to join our Adult 
 Bible Study as we explore Wisdom Literature in the Old Testament (Job\, P
 salms\, Proverbs\, Ecclesiastes\, and Song of Songs). \n\nWhat do we do w
 ith our Christian faith when surrounded by neighborhoods of chaos? \n\nJo
 in us for a discussion on God and meaning as we explore these ancient tex
 ts and their relevance for our lives today. This Adult Bible Study will b
 e led by Congregation intern Jia Cummings. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H
