DESCRIPTION:What do Christians believe happens as we breathe our last mort
 al breath? Is it right to fear death? What did Jesus mean when he promise
 d the thief on the cross that he would be in paradise that very day?\n\nW
 ith a variety of guest speakers\, Adult Forum offers presentations and di
 scussions on a wide range of thought-provoking topics\, including Biblica
 l studies\, current social issues\, and the work of mission agencies. Adu
 lt Forum meets in person in Westbrook 0012 and by Zoom.
DURATION:PT1H
