DESCRIPTION:Dr. Pratapa's research focuses on developing computational app
 roaches to characterize cellular states and decode their molecular driver
 s using multiomic tissue profiles. His recent work includes topology-flex
 ible spatial transforms for aligning RNA\, protein\, and metabolite measu
 rements across tissue sections\, as well as optimal transport-based appro
 aches for adapting representations from pretrained foundation-model to no
 vel experimental contexts.
