DESCRIPTION:Research is a journey filled with discovery\, uncertainty\, an
 d occasional setbacks. In this workshop\, Dr. Steve Nowicki will explore 
 how successful researchers learn from challenges and leverage mentoring r
 elationships to overcome obstacles. Participants will discuss strategies 
 for communicating with mentors\, receiving feedback\, navigating difficul
 ties\, and developing the resilience needed to thrive in research and bey
 ond.
DURATION:PT1H
