DESCRIPTION:This two-hour workshop will cover the basics of putting images
  on screens (making a stencil)\, ink mixing\, and how to effectively use 
 a squeegee to get ink through the screen and print multiple copies of an 
 image. The focus is on printing on paper (which is essentially the same p
 rocess as printing on t-shirts). Everyone will get many chances to print\
 , and will take home a limited edition print of the Declaration of Indepe
 ndence!\n\nThis course is a prerequisite for using the space\; after the 
 workshop everyone who attends the class will be on the "approved printers
 " list and can use the Arts Annex Print Studio at will.
DURATION:PT2H
